\section{VideoRefer Suite}
Our VideoRefer Suite consists of three crucial components: a comprehensive dataset, \textbf{\texttt{VideoRefer-700K}},
 containing high-quality instruction-following object-level annotations; 
 a Video LLM, \textbf{\texttt{VideoRefer}}, capable of pixel-level regional and temporal comprehension; and 
 an evaluation benchmark, \textbf{\texttt{VideoRefer-Bench}}, developed to evaluate models across various video referring tasks.

